WEBVTT

00:01.010 --> 00:04.760
With support from the Penal Hero Unit's
dragoon reinforcements,

00:04.760 --> 00:07.500
we successfully repelled
a band of assassins.

00:07.500 --> 00:10.820
However, the Holy Knights' perimeter
was breached at multiple points,

00:10.820 --> 00:13.200
and nearly half of them were killed.

00:13.700 --> 00:16.870
It was a sneak attack
to isolate Goddess Teoritta and us.

00:17.620 --> 00:19.620
A perfectly executed assault.

00:19.620 --> 00:23.380
Is there a traitor among us?

00:23.380 --> 00:25.760
If we can't trust our own,

00:25.760 --> 00:27.590
we won't be able to fight properly.

00:28.050 --> 00:31.680
The snipers deployed throughout the area
were almost completely wiped out.

00:32.110 --> 00:34.760
I believe the security arrangements
for Goddess Teoritta

00:34.760 --> 00:36.980
should be re-evaluated
by trusted individuals.

00:36.980 --> 00:38.180
There's no point in that.

00:39.170 --> 00:40.190
Tch.

00:40.650 --> 00:43.710
The so-called "trusted individuals"
are themselves suspicious.

00:44.470 --> 00:47.160
Even those sitting here
right now should be suspected.

00:48.270 --> 00:51.860
Shouldn't the penal heroes
be the most suspicious?

00:52.240 --> 00:54.680
At the very least,
we need an internal investigation.

00:54.680 --> 00:57.080
Let's contact
the Twelfth Order of the Holy Knights.

00:57.080 --> 01:01.500
They specialize in espionage,
but they've never appeared publicly.

01:01.880 --> 01:05.000
If we don't know who to trust,
we can't fight.

01:05.470 --> 01:07.210
You guys said it yourself.

01:10.230 --> 01:12.300
I understand each of your opinions.

01:12.300 --> 01:16.470
I'd like to ask
for the advisor's opinion on this matter.

01:16.940 --> 01:19.500
What do you think, High Priest Marlen?

01:19.960 --> 01:20.940
Hmm...

01:21.520 --> 01:22.650
Let's see...

01:23.270 --> 01:27.650
I've only recently been assigned here
from the First Capital.

01:28.060 --> 01:30.530
Including myself,

01:30.530 --> 01:33.900
whether we can trust each other
is an extremely important issue.

01:33.900 --> 01:35.420
But to be honest,

01:35.420 --> 01:38.160
I don't know if I can mobilize
the Intelligence Unit.

01:38.750 --> 01:41.120
How's the prisoner interrogation going,
Patausche?

01:41.830 --> 01:43.830
It's not progressing.

01:43.830 --> 01:48.460
Most of the captured survivors
are adventurers with no key intel.

01:49.380 --> 01:52.430
If only we could catch those assassins...

01:52.430 --> 01:54.310
Don't worry about it.

01:54.310 --> 01:58.180
You carry too much responsibility
for your actions.

01:58.930 --> 02:02.890
Too much regret and anxiety
won't lead to good results.

02:04.840 --> 02:07.650
I'll keep that in mind, Uncle.

02:07.980 --> 02:09.570
Still so reserved.

02:10.090 --> 02:13.650
I suppose that's just like you,
Patausche Kivia.

02:13.650 --> 02:14.820
High Priest.

02:14.820 --> 02:16.490
- Yes?
- Xylo, not another word.

02:16.490 --> 02:19.010
My opinion will surely come in handy.

02:19.450 --> 02:23.670
Otherwise, I wouldn't have raised
my hand before a great man like you.

02:24.800 --> 02:27.790
It may be sharp,
but it helps smooth things over.

02:28.420 --> 02:31.800
Patausche, you can use it as a reference.

02:31.800 --> 02:33.290
Yes...

02:33.840 --> 02:36.800
Well then, Hero Xylo.

02:37.300 --> 02:39.760
Let's hear your opinion.

02:39.760 --> 02:43.230
Alright, we should first look
for the adventurers' intermediary.

02:43.720 --> 02:45.730
In other words, the Guild.

02:53.010 --> 02:54.610
Lideo Sodrick...

02:54.990 --> 02:57.570
Is this guy the representative
of the Adventurers Guild?

02:57.570 --> 03:00.370
It's said that this man's ancestor
gathered private armies

03:00.370 --> 03:04.040
and suppressed the pirates
that rampaged in Korio Bay.

03:04.040 --> 03:06.600
And that seems to be the reason
the Guild was founded.

03:06.600 --> 03:09.000
While it sounds like a good origin story,

03:09.000 --> 03:12.510
it's ultimately just a turf war
between pirates, isn't it?

03:12.510 --> 03:14.150
Regardless of the actual situation,

03:14.150 --> 03:16.470
Lideo Sodrick
is a famous figure in the city.

03:17.240 --> 03:19.930
This place,
known as the "Sodrick's Shell",

03:19.930 --> 03:22.800
can be said to be the history
of the Adventurers Guild itself.

03:28.980 --> 03:30.150
Xylo.

03:32.560 --> 03:33.860
Are things alright?

03:34.360 --> 03:36.510
Huh? What do you mean?

03:36.510 --> 03:38.120
No, I mean...

03:38.120 --> 03:41.700
Were you given
any new punishments or anything?

03:48.280 --> 03:49.500
I'm fine.

03:49.500 --> 03:51.750
No one picked a fight with me.

03:52.640 --> 03:53.670
I see...

03:54.300 --> 03:55.260
What?

03:55.680 --> 03:59.470
Are you trying to get your hands
on that female sniper this time?

03:59.470 --> 04:00.800
Of course not.

04:00.800 --> 04:03.010
That's not what I meant...

04:04.620 --> 04:07.190
No, it's nothing.

04:07.560 --> 04:08.560
Then what is it?

04:12.100 --> 04:14.130
Let's go over the candidates
for the mission.

04:14.130 --> 04:16.360
You can consult me if you'd like.

04:16.360 --> 04:19.820
No, I said there's nothing to discuss.

04:21.589 --> 04:24.290
It's really not like that.

04:25.290 --> 04:28.210
It's not like that at all.

04:31.960 --> 04:34.420
I can't believe we failed...

04:34.770 --> 04:36.880
The dragoon wasn't part of the plan.

04:36.880 --> 04:39.800
The heroes are more formidable
than I'd heard.

04:40.260 --> 04:42.750
What's more,
that guy is a complete amateur.

04:42.750 --> 04:45.350
It's best to remove him or kill him.

04:45.910 --> 04:47.350
Are you talking about me?

04:47.680 --> 04:51.350
Boojum was found at my gambling house.

04:51.350 --> 04:53.170
It was a bloodbath at that time.

04:54.090 --> 04:56.570
Ten adventurers who caused trouble.

04:56.570 --> 04:58.530
Every single one of them died.

05:01.990 --> 05:05.200
If you think he's an amateur,
then educate him properly.

05:06.080 --> 05:07.660
He might hold me back.

05:08.160 --> 05:10.000
I want more money.

05:11.280 --> 05:14.500
You're asking for more money
just because the enemy's a bit stronger?

05:21.800 --> 05:22.840
I see...

05:22.840 --> 05:25.680
This seems like a provocation aimed at me...

05:25.680 --> 05:28.610
Brother, this woman is a stray dog.

05:28.610 --> 05:30.890
She has no specific owner,
so she's very dangerous.

05:31.440 --> 05:33.650
Iri, stand back.

05:34.310 --> 05:35.520
It's fine.

05:37.850 --> 05:38.990
Shiji Bau.

05:38.990 --> 05:42.070
The Adventurers Guild isn't
like the army you were in.

05:44.450 --> 05:46.990
If you quit, you won't get paid.

05:48.170 --> 05:49.950
Prepare three times this amount.

05:52.580 --> 05:54.640
I'll need to hire people too.

05:54.640 --> 05:56.130
A professional this time.

05:56.130 --> 05:57.340
You!

05:57.340 --> 05:59.800
I'd like to ask for more money too.

06:00.590 --> 06:02.590
I want to buy another book.

06:03.260 --> 06:05.550
I really like this author.

06:06.150 --> 06:07.970
Altoyard Comette...

06:08.600 --> 06:10.980
He's a great poet.

06:15.560 --> 06:18.320
Brother, do you think it'll go well?

06:18.870 --> 06:21.860
You don't have to worry
about anything.

06:26.740 --> 06:29.290
Is there someone you're worried about?

06:48.680 --> 06:50.930
It's rare to see you
so early in the morning.

06:50.930 --> 06:53.480
Did Neely kick you
out of the dragon stable?

06:53.480 --> 06:54.290
That's right.

06:54.290 --> 06:54.770
What?

06:54.770 --> 06:56.910
Neely's jealous.

06:56.910 --> 07:00.230
She saw me with the other dragons.

07:00.230 --> 07:02.690
But it's not what she thinks...

07:02.690 --> 07:06.280
Hey, don't push Jayce's buttons.

07:06.790 --> 07:09.810
You two fight every chance you get.

07:09.810 --> 07:11.160
That's not true.

07:11.540 --> 07:12.740
Yes, it is.

07:12.740 --> 07:16.620
From my perspective, you two are
the epitome of anger and violence.

07:16.620 --> 07:18.790
- If possible, I hope
- They're heroes.

07:18.790 --> 07:20.630
- we can stagger our meal times.
- The one with the scary eyes

07:20.630 --> 07:22.250
is Xylo Forbartz, right?

07:22.250 --> 07:23.760
- Where's Teoritta?
- I heard he's a lunatic who carved

07:23.760 --> 07:24.840
- Isn't she with you?
- sacred seals all over his body.

07:24.840 --> 07:26.300
She's still asleep.

07:26.950 --> 07:30.260
And, I need a favor from you.
She can't hear about this.

07:30.720 --> 07:31.740
Huh?

07:31.740 --> 07:33.010
Oh, come on.

07:33.010 --> 07:35.020
You want me to do something again,
don't you?

07:35.020 --> 07:36.360
That's right.

07:36.360 --> 07:38.570
And it's something dangerous, right?

07:38.570 --> 07:41.640
Something you can't
bring Teoritta along for?

07:41.640 --> 07:44.010
Yeah, you get it, don't you?

07:44.860 --> 07:45.740
Sigh...

07:45.740 --> 07:47.530
Come on, cheer up.

07:48.200 --> 07:50.410
You can go out without handcuffs,
you know.

07:50.740 --> 07:54.370
That's easy to say,
but Tsav had a hard time, didn't he?

07:54.370 --> 07:56.220
I heard his right arm was crushed.

07:56.680 --> 07:57.790
Yeah.

07:57.790 --> 08:00.500
He was lucky
that it was just his right arm.

08:01.590 --> 08:04.010
By the way, what kind of operation is it?

08:04.920 --> 08:07.170
First, you'll infiltrate
the Adventurers Guild.

08:08.180 --> 08:11.430
If it's the Adventurers Guild,
wouldn't it be better to ask Rhyno?

08:11.430 --> 08:13.310
He used to be an adventurer, right?

08:13.310 --> 08:14.560
No.

08:14.560 --> 08:16.640
Rhyno is in the punishment room right now.

08:16.640 --> 08:18.600
We can't predict what he'll do.

08:19.400 --> 08:22.010
What about Venetim?

08:22.010 --> 08:24.360
He went to the repair shop
with His Majesty.

08:24.360 --> 08:26.780
It seems they finally found
a suitable leg.

08:26.780 --> 08:28.830
But...

08:29.700 --> 08:31.870
If you won't do it, Dotta, then I will.

08:32.380 --> 08:33.580
I'm free today anyway.

08:33.909 --> 08:35.320
What? Really?

08:35.320 --> 08:36.789
Then— Ah.

08:37.250 --> 08:40.169
Dotta, I need your skills.

08:41.539 --> 08:43.669
Sigh... alright.

08:45.310 --> 08:48.010
Don't cause trouble for Dotta.

08:48.670 --> 08:54.000
Dotta once fed his own hand
to a hungry dragon.

08:54.770 --> 08:57.100
I don't even know
if I could go that far.

08:59.900 --> 09:02.400
He respects you, surprisingly.

09:02.890 --> 09:04.650
Let's not talk about that.

09:04.650 --> 09:05.530
So?

09:05.530 --> 09:07.070
What exactly are we going to do?

09:07.610 --> 09:09.650
In what form do you
want me to infiltrate?

09:10.780 --> 09:11.990
Well...

09:23.210 --> 09:24.840
Is there a problem?

09:25.340 --> 09:29.550
Or do you still think I look like
I'm wearing men's clothes?

09:33.720 --> 09:35.930
No, this outfit suits you.

09:36.310 --> 09:38.640
You truly look like a noble lady.

09:39.000 --> 09:41.350
I'm sure you'll have many suitors.

09:43.810 --> 09:46.520
N-No need to flatter me like that.

09:46.520 --> 09:48.280
Even if you compliment me,

09:48.280 --> 09:51.240
it won't affect my mood at all.

09:51.580 --> 09:52.770
That's good.

09:52.770 --> 09:55.740
But what kind of job request
should we make up...?

09:56.910 --> 10:00.910
When it comes to Adventurers Guild jobs,
it's about eliminating faeries, right?

10:00.910 --> 10:03.980
That's the military's job, right?

10:03.980 --> 10:06.200
How about dealing with bandits?

10:06.920 --> 10:10.250
Both of you are using
way too much violence.

10:10.250 --> 10:12.880
If this were the border,
they might get a request like that.

10:12.880 --> 10:14.720
But this is Ioff.

10:14.720 --> 10:17.680
What kind of request
do you think is suitable then?

10:20.770 --> 10:22.980
Ah... then...

10:23.480 --> 10:27.190
We'll set you up
as a nobleman's wife and her lover.

10:27.190 --> 10:28.320
- What?!
- Huh?

10:28.320 --> 10:30.770
And the two of you
are plotting to kill her husband.

10:31.150 --> 10:34.280
Is there a nobleman you want to kill?

10:37.160 --> 10:39.160
Defendant Dotta Luzulas,

10:39.700 --> 10:43.290
you have over 1,000 criminal charges.

10:44.660 --> 10:45.790
Yes...

10:46.170 --> 10:49.760
But there's only one crime
you're being charged with here.

10:49.760 --> 10:52.760
That is the crime of escaping
from the royal castle prison

10:52.760 --> 10:55.760
and stealing that dragon.

10:58.680 --> 11:01.280
Huh? Wait... wait a minute.

11:01.280 --> 11:02.470
What is it?

11:02.470 --> 11:03.670
What about that child?

11:03.670 --> 11:06.200
Doesn't that count as one of my crimes?

11:06.200 --> 11:07.860
What are you talking about?

11:07.860 --> 11:09.570
The crown prince!

11:09.570 --> 11:11.670
- He said the crown prince.
- What does he mean?

11:11.670 --> 11:13.570
What does this have to do
with His Highness?

11:13.900 --> 11:17.130
That child told me,
"Please save me."

11:17.130 --> 11:18.280
It's true.

11:18.710 --> 11:20.780
He said he was locked up
in the royal castle

11:20.780 --> 11:22.240
and asked me to help him escape.

11:22.240 --> 11:24.710
That's why I tried to use
the dragon to help him escape.

11:24.710 --> 11:26.670
Cease this nonsense!

11:28.130 --> 11:30.130
There's no truth to the claim

11:30.130 --> 11:33.090
that the crown prince
ever said such things to you.

11:33.680 --> 11:36.300
Nor is it true that he wished
to leave the royal castle.

11:36.300 --> 11:39.140
No... that's not true.

11:39.140 --> 11:41.560
I met him while escaping prison.

11:41.560 --> 11:44.520
He must be the first prince
of this Federated Kingdom.

11:44.850 --> 11:46.770
He's about ten years old,

11:46.770 --> 11:48.270
with timid eyes.

11:49.050 --> 11:50.920
He told me the royal family is strange.

11:50.920 --> 11:53.190
He also said His Majesty
had been acting strangely,

11:53.190 --> 11:54.440
so it must be the chancellor—

11:54.440 --> 11:57.200
Silence, Dotta Luzulas.

11:57.200 --> 11:58.700
N-No.

11:58.700 --> 12:01.280
There really is something wrong
with the royal family.

12:01.280 --> 12:05.350
After all, the crown prince
even tried to rely on someone like me!

12:05.910 --> 12:08.000
To rely on someone like me...

12:08.000 --> 12:10.960
a m-mere petty thief.

12:11.340 --> 12:12.750
Silence!

12:12.750 --> 12:15.420
Even I have a conscience.

12:15.880 --> 12:18.880
It's just that not many people
can stir my conscience.

12:19.430 --> 12:23.720
But if someone is weaker than me,
like the crown prince was then,

12:24.240 --> 12:26.730
it's only natural to want
to help him, isn't it?

12:32.400 --> 12:34.270
This is too strange.

12:34.790 --> 12:37.990
If that's the case,
who would help that child then?

12:39.030 --> 12:42.280
Please, you must save that child!

12:42.700 --> 12:45.200
It seems we can't continue
the interrogation.

12:45.200 --> 12:49.420
Inquisitor, I believe the death penalty
is the most appropriate verdict.

12:49.420 --> 12:51.170
Yes, you're right.

12:51.930 --> 12:56.130
But this man has been sentenced
to an even harsher punishment.

12:57.220 --> 12:58.760
And who rendered this judgment?

12:59.340 --> 13:02.220
It was proposed
by the Central Alliance of Nobles.

13:02.670 --> 13:04.600
It's already been decided.

13:06.890 --> 13:08.020
What the heck...

13:08.020 --> 13:10.060
Next time, I'll definitely steal it...

13:10.440 --> 13:12.230
Dotta Luzulas.

13:12.230 --> 13:13.270
You are being sentenced

13:13.650 --> 13:15.610
to serve as a hero.

13:20.700 --> 13:21.780
Sigh...

13:22.780 --> 13:24.200
It's a huge hassle,

13:24.950 --> 13:26.790
but I have to do it...

13:36.880 --> 13:38.800
Hey, I have some good stuff here.

13:38.800 --> 13:40.060
Would you like some?

13:40.630 --> 13:41.880
Tch, they're ignoring me.

13:41.880 --> 13:42.470
Damn it.

13:43.250 --> 13:44.760
This is unpleasant.

13:46.970 --> 13:48.390
Dragon's Breath...

13:48.390 --> 13:51.100
Is that the tobacco
that became popular because of Jayce?

13:51.100 --> 13:53.460
That is a clear and undeniable crime.

13:56.810 --> 13:58.030
By the way,

13:58.030 --> 14:00.490
why did you join the military?

14:02.230 --> 14:03.450
What do you mean?

14:03.840 --> 14:06.410
The daughter of a priest
who holds vast territories

14:06.410 --> 14:08.910
wouldn't need to join the army,
would she?

14:10.140 --> 14:11.290
That's because...

14:12.960 --> 14:15.540
Both of my parents are priests.

14:15.540 --> 14:17.890
They both hold positions at the Temple.

14:17.890 --> 14:19.880
And they've gained
various benefits from it.

14:20.840 --> 14:22.320
Benefits...

14:22.320 --> 14:26.300
Are they those noble priests
who turn authority and faith into money?

14:26.760 --> 14:27.620
Yes.

14:28.180 --> 14:31.380
It seems they didn't rely solely
on legitimate means like donations.

14:31.890 --> 14:35.150
I hated that about my parents.

14:35.730 --> 14:38.980
So I wanted to live
a different life from them.

14:38.980 --> 14:40.770
That's why I decided to join the army.

14:45.190 --> 14:46.160
That's...

14:46.600 --> 14:48.910
It's my first training sword.

14:49.960 --> 14:51.870
My uncle bought it for me.

14:54.190 --> 14:58.460
I want to live my own life
with my own talent.

14:58.880 --> 15:02.470
My uncle supported me in that.

15:06.690 --> 15:08.070
By the way, Xylo.

15:08.070 --> 15:11.560
Your... fiancée...

15:11.560 --> 15:12.310
Xylo.

15:12.920 --> 15:14.560
I went to see the guild.

15:15.540 --> 15:17.480
That was fast. Impressive.

15:18.050 --> 15:20.020
Almost a little too fast.

15:20.390 --> 15:22.610
Their security seems to be very tight.

15:23.030 --> 15:25.070
There are about 20 guards.

15:25.070 --> 15:26.490
That's fewer than I expected.

15:26.490 --> 15:29.090
But there are strange children
wandering around.

15:29.580 --> 15:31.290
I think they are assassins.

15:31.290 --> 15:33.000
Children?

15:33.000 --> 15:34.250
Unforgivable...

15:34.660 --> 15:40.110
I've heard of raising orphans
to turn them into loyal soldiers.

15:43.640 --> 15:44.590
Anyway,

15:45.430 --> 15:48.890
I just need to kidnap the representative
while you two infiltrate, right?

15:48.890 --> 15:52.060
Though I don't have any pleasant
memories of kidnapping people.

15:52.060 --> 15:53.560
Just do it.

15:54.040 --> 15:57.320
Kivia, you're the daughter
of a wealthy noble.

15:57.320 --> 15:58.730
And I'm your lover.

16:00.150 --> 16:02.110
I... I know.

16:02.110 --> 16:03.130
Leave it to me!

16:04.780 --> 16:05.820
Ouch.

16:08.200 --> 16:12.160
Looks like it's truly the penal hero,
Xylo Forbartz.

16:12.160 --> 16:16.120
There's no doubt
the other woman is a Holy Knight.

16:16.500 --> 16:18.190
Xylo Forbartz.

16:18.190 --> 16:19.750
This is the worst...

16:19.750 --> 16:22.590
But if this goes well...

16:23.020 --> 16:25.380
If we can capture him alive...

16:26.450 --> 16:28.590
Then I'll wait
for the right time to strike.

16:29.760 --> 16:32.010
Contact Shiji Bau and the others.

16:32.010 --> 16:34.680
Just in case, wake up Duhrsami too.

16:37.430 --> 16:39.390
Don't let them go back.

16:39.770 --> 16:40.770
Understood.

16:51.490 --> 16:53.700
This is for my family too.

17:01.660 --> 17:02.380
Hm?

17:05.339 --> 17:07.420
I'd like you to kill someone for me.

17:08.630 --> 17:09.630
What?

17:09.630 --> 17:12.839
I know it's a rude request,
but I would prefer someone experienced.

17:13.660 --> 17:16.060
Excuse me, but who are you?

17:16.060 --> 17:17.560
I'm Madleen.

17:18.040 --> 17:19.839
Please don't ask for my family name.

17:19.839 --> 17:20.810
Yes...

17:23.480 --> 17:26.480
Well then, who referred you here?

17:27.000 --> 17:29.320
Do you take assassination requests or not?

17:29.830 --> 17:30.700
Give me an answer.

17:31.110 --> 17:32.570
Ms. Madleen.

17:32.570 --> 17:35.160
We don't accept just any job.

17:35.990 --> 17:37.790
I'm sorry, miss.

17:37.790 --> 17:39.560
My lady has lived a sheltered life,

17:39.560 --> 17:41.620
and she's never been to a place like this.

17:41.620 --> 17:44.790
We don't have a letter of recommendation,
but we're truly at our wits' end.

17:44.790 --> 17:48.800
Worst-case scenario, at least let us
leave this town without a trace.

17:49.670 --> 17:51.470
Let me ask you this.

17:52.000 --> 17:53.550
Who do you want to kill?

17:54.720 --> 17:57.850
Our target is her noble husband,
the bridge keepers of Ginai's...

17:57.850 --> 17:59.520
Have you heard of the Hystead family?

17:59.520 --> 18:00.550
No.

18:00.550 --> 18:03.230
He's the third son
from one of their branch families.

18:03.230 --> 18:05.110
There's been some trouble.

18:05.520 --> 18:08.070
Although I married
into the Hystead family,

18:08.410 --> 18:10.610
this man and I... uhm...

18:10.610 --> 18:14.070
swore our vows
under the sacred hargra tree!

18:14.070 --> 18:15.120
Yes...

18:15.120 --> 18:19.410
I want to kill my husband
and marry this man.

18:19.790 --> 18:22.750
I-I don't mind eloping with him!

18:23.210 --> 18:26.130
Ah, please... please wait a moment.

18:26.840 --> 18:29.070
- Those two look like trouble...
- I feel like they're doubting us.

18:29.070 --> 18:30.550
- Should we report this to the higher-ups?
- I feel like they're doubting us.

18:30.550 --> 18:32.300
You're not just imagining it.

18:32.300 --> 18:34.600
- We don't know if she's really a noble.
- This is bad. What should we do?

18:34.600 --> 18:37.220
- You're right...
- If that's the case, we'll make a scene.

18:37.530 --> 18:38.440
What?

18:38.440 --> 18:40.870
We'll cause a ruckus and create chaos.

18:40.870 --> 18:43.190
It's what you'd call stealing
in the midst of chaos.

18:43.190 --> 18:46.520
And the one we're taking
is Lideo Sodrick himself.

18:46.520 --> 18:49.150
Wh-What kind of reckless plan is this?

18:49.150 --> 18:50.940
Anyway, let's do this.

18:50.940 --> 18:52.610
We'll start with those guys...

18:54.070 --> 18:57.030
You two seem to be looking
for skilled adventurers.

18:57.530 --> 18:58.660
- Wha—
- You are...

18:59.120 --> 19:00.990
You're Ms. Renzari.

19:01.620 --> 19:05.450
You're the wife of a nobleman,
and you're her lover.

19:05.450 --> 19:06.420
Am I right?

19:09.780 --> 19:11.790
May I use the room upstairs?

19:15.240 --> 19:17.090
How embarrassing, Xylo.

19:18.140 --> 19:20.060
It's the reaction I expected.

19:20.060 --> 19:21.800
What an absolute fool.

19:21.800 --> 19:26.440
If I hadn't come to your aid,
you would have been all tied up.

19:26.440 --> 19:30.270
No, we were planning
to cause a commotion there.

19:30.270 --> 19:30.980
That's right.

19:30.980 --> 19:35.030
And our comrade will sneak in and find
the evidence. Everything is arranged.

19:35.440 --> 19:38.490
You're a member
of the Holy Knights, right?

19:38.890 --> 19:41.740
I am the Commander of the Thirteenth Order
of the Holy Knights,

19:41.740 --> 19:42.980
Patausche Kivia.

19:43.450 --> 19:46.510
Could you not spoil my fiancé too much?

19:47.000 --> 19:52.130
That man is still disgraceful, uneducated,
immature, and thoughtless.

19:52.590 --> 19:54.920
I don't want outsiders interfering.

19:54.920 --> 19:56.340
What outsiders?

19:56.340 --> 19:59.260
You're the outsider in this operation.

19:59.260 --> 20:00.930
I'm his fiancée.

20:00.930 --> 20:03.220
I'll stay by his side no matter what.

20:03.220 --> 20:05.390
Th-That doesn't change anything!

20:09.650 --> 20:13.870
I knew you two wouldn't get along
because of your personalities,

20:13.870 --> 20:15.280
but it's worse than I thought.

20:15.280 --> 20:17.240
What? Personalities?

20:17.240 --> 20:19.200
You said we don't get along?

20:19.200 --> 20:22.370
Why is that the best
you can come up with?

20:22.370 --> 20:24.120
Are you really an idiot?

20:24.120 --> 20:26.650
No, he's beyond that level.

20:26.650 --> 20:29.420
He's terrible at reading people.

20:29.420 --> 20:30.770
I agree.

20:30.770 --> 20:33.300
His eyesight is like that
of a susubana mole.

20:33.300 --> 20:36.760
You could even say that the trees
by the roadside are smarter than him.

20:36.760 --> 20:39.340
Don't act all buddy-buddy
only when you're scolding me.

20:39.800 --> 20:41.840
This is not the time to play.

20:43.470 --> 20:46.430
And speaking of which, why are you here?

20:46.430 --> 20:49.350
We're posing as adventurers
to investigate.

20:50.020 --> 20:53.900
We're just one step away
from contacting Lideo Sodrick.

20:53.900 --> 20:56.070
Well then, sorry to bother you.

20:56.610 --> 20:57.990
Right now, we're also...

20:59.320 --> 21:00.950
Excuse me, esteemed guests.

21:00.950 --> 21:04.160
The Guild Master wishes
to know the details of your requests.

21:06.540 --> 21:09.040
Frenci, if you're going to pull out,
now's the time.

21:09.540 --> 21:11.030
Don't be ridiculous.

21:11.030 --> 21:12.830
I'm so dumbfounded,
I can't even speak.

21:18.090 --> 21:20.590
It's so much easier
to just make a scene after all.

21:31.390 --> 21:31.900
Oh.

21:40.070 --> 21:41.110
You have no manners.

21:43.030 --> 21:44.870
It seems you weren't taught well.

22:16.690 --> 22:17.650
Here.

22:21.990 --> 22:23.030
Ah...

22:32.550 --> 22:34.750
Looks like this is going
to cause quite a stir.

22:38.710 --> 22:40.880
We didn't intend to do this...

22:41.340 --> 22:42.520
Unbelievable.

22:42.520 --> 22:44.090
You actually did it.

22:44.090 --> 22:44.880
Yes.

22:45.240 --> 22:47.640
While we drive Lideo Sodrick out,

22:48.050 --> 22:50.350
we'll clean up the entire town as well.

22:51.600 --> 22:52.810
What is this...?

22:53.260 --> 22:55.600
This is what you call
a contribution to the community.

22:55.940 --> 22:57.860
This is really bad!

23:11.160 --> 23:14.080
SENTENCED TO BE A HERO
